<li>&lt;a href="Tut%20wuri%20handayani"&gt;Tut wuri handayani&lt;/a&gt;, nyurung saka mburi lan mènèhi kasemptan andhahan supaya duwé kréasi;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Waspada%20purbawisesa"&gt;Waspada purbawisesa&lt;/a&gt;, waspada;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ambeg%20parama%20arta"&gt;Ambeg parama arta&lt;/a&gt;, ndhisikaké prakara kang luwih wigati;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Prasaja"&gt;Prasaja&lt;/a&gt;, prasaja;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Setya"&gt;Setya&lt;/a&gt;, loyal, utawa setia;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Gemi%20nastiti"&gt;Gemi nastiti&lt;/a&gt;, gemi utawa hémat;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Belaka"&gt;Belaka&lt;/a&gt;, jujur, transparan lan blaka suta;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Legawa"&gt;Legawa&lt;/a&gt;, ikhlas lan ora égois.</li>
</ul>
