<li>&lt;a href="Gabah%20Garing%20Pan%C3%A8n"&gt;Gabah Garing Panèn&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="basa%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;basa Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;: Gabah Kering Panen),</li>
